---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 14px
    primaryColor: "#EDF2F7"
    primaryTextColor: "#25364A"
    primaryBorderColor: "#879AB0"
    lineColor: "#8B949E"
    noteBkgColor: "#F7F1E5"
    noteTextColor: "#514532"
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: true
    useMaxWidth: false
    actorMargin: 28
    messageMargin: 24
    noteMargin: 12
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as OCC / IAM / State
  participant W as Worker / RepoDriver
  participant C as Compute
  participant A as Ordinary Agent
  participant S as Credential process
  participant G as GitHub
  Note over O,G: 1. Admit immutable repository authority
  O->>O: Authorize and commit revision plus queued work
  O-->>W: Frozen binding and original deadline
  W->>O: Commit opening attempt before external effect
  W->>S: Open session over private Unix control
  S->>S: Resolve Namespace, repository and profile policy
  S->>S: Match frozen grant, bound duration and original deadline
  alt Admission denied
    S-->>W: Refuse before authority or files
  else Created
    S-->>W: Session plus one-time private files
  else Lost response with surviving service knowledge
    W->>S: Reconcile original admission, recovery-only
    S-->>W: Safe status or authoritative missing in surviving service
    Note over W,S: Outage is not absence. Retain matching files or close known-undelivered authority before replacement.
  else Admission or effect history lost
    Note over W,S: Safe replacement remains unfinished. Missing status cannot prove provider settlement.
  end
  Note over O,G: 2. Publish a complete material generation
  W->>O: Commit session identity before delivery
  W->>C: New files or matching retained material
  C->>C: Validate complete generation, atomically publish runtime files
  C-->>A: Private bearer/client files and readiness
  Note over O,G: 3. Authorize one effective request
  A->>S: Git or selected gh request over verified HTTPS
  S->>S: Check session, repository, profile and deadline
  alt Scope denied
    S-->>A: Refuse before acquisition or dispatch
  else Scope admitted
    S->>G: Coalesced demand acquisition under original grant
    G-->>S: Credential or uncertain outcome
    S->>S: Capture before acceptance, retain original attempt
    alt Credential accepted
      S->>S: Recheck full remaining validity before dispatch
      S->>G: Authenticate one bounded exchange
      G-->>S: Response or possible-write uncertainty
      S-->>A: Result or uncertainty without automatic write replay
      Note over S,G: Join I/O before releasing custody. Renewal preserves bearer and deadline.
    else Issuance unknown or credential rejected
      S-->>A: Refuse dispatch and retain original obligations
      Note over S,G: Unknown issuance blocks automatic remint.
    end
  end
  Note over O,G: 4. Register closure, retire runtime and retain unsettled cleanup
  W->>O: Persist closing phases and register owned cleanup
  W->>S: Attempt session close
  alt Service available
    S->>S: Deny new use before cancellation
    S-->>W: Status, possibly CLOSED with obligations
  else Service unavailable
    Note over W,S: Existing cleanup owner retains work
  end
  W->>O: Recheck owned stop intent
  W->>C: Retire exact runtime and material without awaiting DISPOSED
  Note over W,G: Runtime stop does not prove session closure, disposal or provider revocation.
  opt Provider obligations remain, independent of runtime retirement
    W->>S: Existing cleanup owner continues reconciliation
    S->>G: Settle original owned provider obligations
    G-->>S: Confirmed outcome or retained uncertainty
    S->>S: DISPOSED only after all obligations resolve
  end
  Note over O,C: Agent deletion and Namespace cleanup joins remain corrective work.
  Note over W,S: Worker-container restart may preserve service knowledge. Worker-Pod replacement loses the sidecar too.
  Note over O,G: Lost effect-history recovery remains unfinished. No safe remint or replay follows from local absence.
